[{"id":2708923764,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hduV0","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15639?u=e9aef7bb2de12f063a887cb9fbca2cad8d8ade43&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/DanielKinsman","id":15639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjM5","login":"DanielKinsman","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104347#pullrequestreview-2708923764","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104347","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-03-24T01:27:47Z"},{"id":2711354475,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hm_xr","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected.\r\n\r\nThis has a positive impact on MovieWriter speed when using AVI (MJPEG) output. Example with [godot-reflection](https://github.com/Calinou/godot-reflection)'s benchmark mode with JPEG quality set to 100. The time represented is the time it takes to record a movie of the full benchmark run (1 minute at 60 FPS):\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n2m43s (36% of real-time speed) | 2m18s (43% of real-time speed)\r\n\r\nOn the other hand, binary size grows a fair bit for stripped Linux x86_64 release export templates (`production=yes lto=full`):\r\n\r\nBefore | After\r\n-|-\r\n72,679,096 bytes | 73,150,360 bytes (+ 471 KB)\r\n\r\nI'm not sure why the size increase is so large compared to what @akien-mga reported.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104347#pullrequestreview-2711354475","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104347","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-24T18:32:21Z"},{"id":2711358394,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6hnAu6","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32321?u=c2e06a3d2b49a467aa907e54aa259516440267cc&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/fire","id":32321,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzIx","login":"fire","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/fire"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104347#pullrequestreview-2711358394","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104347","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-03-24T18:34:11Z"},{"id":2809480957,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6ndUb9","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?u=4a42fd867f2c449fcc23adf635dd574dae98e6c2&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","login":"akien-mga","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga"},"body":"Did a final review pass and some light testing, everything looks good to me.\r\n\r\nJust pointed out a few minor adjustments to copyright, documentation and buildsystem stuff.\r\n\r\nFinal size impact comparison on a Linux release export template:\r\n```\r\n$ lsmb bin\r\n-rwxr-xr-x. 1 akien akien   67.70MB May 1 11:17 godot.linuxbsd.template_release.x86_64.libjpeg-turbo\r\n-rwxr-xr-x. 1 akien akien   67.36MB May 1 11:14 godot.linuxbsd.template_release.x86_64.master\r\n```\r\n\r\nSo it adds 340 KiB.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104347#pullrequestreview-2809480957","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104347","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-05-01T10:25:18Z"},{"id":2810914660,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6niydk","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15639?u=e9aef7bb2de12f063a887cb9fbca2cad8d8ade43&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/DanielKinsman","id":15639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjM5","login":"DanielKinsman","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104347#pullrequestreview-2810914660","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/104347","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-05-01T23:13:35Z"},{"id":2810919593,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6nizqp","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15639?u=e9aef7bb2de12f063a887cb9fbca2cad8d8ade43&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/DanielKinsman","id":15639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1NjM5","login":"DanielKinsman","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/DanielKinsman"},"body":"","html_url":"https://git